<title>USA: Wall Street stocks open lower on revised GDP number.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks open lower on revised GDP number.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks opened slightly lower after a hefty upward revision to second quarter gross domestic product triggered selling pressure in U.S. Treasuries.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials own 14 to 5698.</p>
<p>The 30-year U.S. Treasury bond was down 11/32 to yield 7.01 percent.</p>
